[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25022.23, "timestamp": "06:57:02", "text": "让我来创作？我可以去。等等，你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25023.83, "timestamp": "06:57:03", "text": "玩过吗？是否有教程？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25026.708, "timestamp": "06:57:06", "text": "某物？我没玩过。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25028.628, "timestamp": "06:57:08", "text": "我告诉你吧。据我所知"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25031.03, "timestamp": "06:57:11", "text": "这款游戏的功能。你好。你好。如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25032.39, "timestamp": "06:57:12", "text": "你是？希望你今天一切顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25035.99, "timestamp": "06:57:15", "text": "你好。所以，当我看到某人时，我就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25038.948, "timestamp": "06:57:18", "text": "玩这个游戏。呃，我觉得你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25043.03, "timestamp": "06:57:23", "text": "应该去类似的地方和那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25045.27, "timestamp": "06:57:25", "text": "那些地方的人可能就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25047.67, "timestamp": "06:57:27", "text": "闹鬼。那里好像有鬼魂出没。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25049.91, "timestamp": "06:57:29", "text": "你有一台相机，你有一支手电筒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25052.07, "timestamp": "06:57:32", "text": "所以你基本上只需要识别出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25053.99, "timestamp": "06:57:33", "text": "鬼魂，他们是什么类型的鬼魂？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25056.39, "timestamp": "06:57:36", "text": "是，你必须拍照。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25060.15, "timestamp": "06:57:40", "text": "然后，通过这样做，你就得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25062.708, "timestamp": "06:57:42", "text": "用美元，你可以购买其他东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25065.27, "timestamp": "06:57:45", "text": "东西。哦，你知道的，而且这种情况还在继续。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25066.788, "timestamp": "06:57:46", "text": "没完没了。你去不同的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25068.868, "timestamp": "06:57:48", "text": "而且你还能赚到东西。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25072.788, "timestamp": "06:57:52", "text": "就是这样。我懂了。是的。"}]